    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/todo-manager.md#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Check before you create — `beans create` is not idempotent (STRICT)",
      "prov:value": "That is the older advice and it is what this line used to say. It writes no holder note, so the claim is invisible to `beans:claim`'s own `already-claimed` check — measured 2026-09-25, 97 of the 100 non-epic `in-progress` beans on `main` record no holder, and the guard answered \"go ahead\" for all 97 (bean `c3d7`). Two sessions claimed one bean 61 s apart on 2026-09-19 and shipped two PRs; that is the failure the tool exists to stop, and routing around it puts it back.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean `c3d7`",
        "2026-09-25",
        "2026-09-19"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-19",
        "2026-09-25"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/todo-manager.md#provenance-5",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Check before you create — `beans create` is not idempotent (STRICT)",
      "prov:value": "Measured when it landed: a reworded title for the known duplicate pair `3ozg`/`rmcf` found both at 0.72–0.75. **Measured in `qou` 2026-10-04: most of its 141 duplicate groups were generator re-runs filing one Lean declaration under a new title** (bean `yr93`).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "`rmcf`",
        "bean `yr93`",
        "2026-10-04"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-04"
      ]
