    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/todo-manager.md#provenance-11",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "WHICH parent — the criterion nobody wrote down",
      "prov:value": "That sentence was missing from this skill until 2026-09-20, and its absence is measurable: in one session six new beans were all filed under `yj32`, the epic that session was working in, while their subjects belonged to four different epics. The owner spotted it — *\"beans misfiled... wrong skills guidance? tools guidance?\"* — and the answer was yes, this file.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "`yj32`",
        "owner",
        "2026-09-20"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/todo-manager.md#provenance-12",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "A session is a log, not a parent",
      "prov:value": "Until 2026-10-04 Core Directive 1 read *\"Every session is a Bean … you MUST create a parent bean (`--type milestone` or `--epic`)\"*, with `beans create \"Session: <Branch/Goal>\" **Measured in the `qou` folio 2026-10-04: 292 of its 353 `type: epic` beans were session logs** (bean `8unf`, issue #2106).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean `8unf`",
        "#2106",
        "2026-10-04"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/todo-manager.md#provenance-13",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "A GOAL is a `milestone` bean, and an epic joins one by parenting to it",
      "prov:value": "**Measured 2026-09-20, bean `wqht`.** The owner had stated three goals in chat.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean `wqht`",
        "owner",
        "2026-09-20"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ]
    },
    {
