        "2026-09-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/todo-manager.md#provenance-15",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "date",
      "cat-harness:section": "After you create — parent it, and re-run the guard before you push",
      "prov:value": "The way it gets past you is procedural, and it happened **twice in one session** on 2026-09-20:",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/todo-manager.md#provenance-16",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "date",
      "cat-harness:section": "A new bean also owes `readme:subgraphs` — and this is the most-missed step",
      "prov:value": "**Measured 2026-10-03: three separate PRs failed this gate on the same day** — one for a new bean, one for a new bean on a dispatched agent's branch, and one for a newly declared subgraph directory.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-03"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-03"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/todo-manager.md#provenance-17",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "date",
      "cat-harness:section": "When the `beans` CLI is not there — you are still not read-only",
      "prov:value": "That is not hypothetical: it is what happened on 2026-09-18 across two merged PRs.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-18"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-18"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/todo-manager.md#provenance-18",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "date",
      "cat-harness:section": "Check before you WORK — a checkbox is a claim, not a measurement (STRICT)",
      "prov:value": "It is *acting on a stale claim*, and twice in one session (2026-09-20) that came within a single edit of re-introducing a defect a test had been written to catch.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/todo-manager.md#provenance-19",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Measured, one session, four beans",
      "prov:value": "| bean | what the file said | what was true | |---|---|---| | `sa8y` | four items open | one open; two done, one a **deliberate** decision | | `vo9d` | five items open | one open; four done by siblings | | `30hn` | 16 of 33 undeclared | 14 of 41 — and the mover was **this session** | | `koth` / `b11x` | two beans | one defect, filed **3m53s apart**",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "`sa8y`",
        "`vo9d`",
        "`30hn`",
        "`koth`",
        "`b11x`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/todo-manager.md#provenance-20",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "The two failures this prevents, and they are different",
      "prov:value": "`vo9d`'s four items were done by `11d43ce4fb` and `ca5ec3e373`, neither of which ticked a box.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "`vo9d`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/todo-manager.md#provenance-21",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "The two failures this prevents, and they are different",
      "prov:value": "`sa8y`'s *\"the three unbound lanes get roles\"* reads like a gap. The roles exist; what is missing is `lanes`, and its absence is deliberate — `bootstrap/scenarios/roles.json` carries a `_lanes_comment` explaining that binding them mints three dangling links in the root's graph, with bean `pve3` owning the question. **Doing the obvious thing would have re-created the exact shape of the wrong fix `sa8y` exists to record.**",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "`sa8y`",
        "bean `pve3`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/todo-manager.md#provenance-22",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "What \"re-measure\" means, concretely",
      "prov:value": "`sa8y`'s headline finding was fixed hours earlier; `kg:audit` says so in one command. `vo9d` describes a Tool node its own checkbox still shows unticked. `git log -S` on the symbol or the file against the bean's `created_at` separates *fixed since* from *wrong when written* — and `vo9d` was the second: it listed `check-l1-complete.ts` as having no callers when `ingest-document.ts` had imported from it 32 minutes earlier.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "`sa8y`",
        "`vo9d`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/todo-manager.md#provenance-23",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Working with Beans",
      "prov:value": "- When starting work: `bun run cat beans:claim <id>` — a claim goes through the claim tool, never through `beans update`, so it is visible to the next session's check (bean `c3d7`)",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean `c3d7`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/todo-manager.md#provenance-24",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "issue",
      "cat-harness:section": "Working with Beans",
      "prov:value": "When a bean is part of a work plan — it delivers one or more `req:` statements (or a plan's `REQ-###` / `FR-###`) — it names them in its body and its `## Done when` is **copied from their success criteria**, one checkbox per criterion, with the criterion's key (issue #2405 FR-007). The bean ids are also listed in the requirement set's `workPlan` — a set at `planned` with none is refused by `check:requirements` (issue #2405, FR-010/FR-012).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "#2405",
        "FR-007",
        "FR-010",
        "FR-012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/todo-manager.md#provenance-25",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Archiving — two dispositions, and they answer different questions",
      "prov:value": "Owner, 2026-09-20: *\"outline both options and why used for. that is part of the skills to explain in context of larger process.\"*",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "Owner",
        "2026-09-20"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/todo-manager.md#provenance-26",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Where this sits against `resolve` — two layers, not two spellings",
      "prov:value": "Measured 2026-09-20: every process that touches the work plan reaches `resolve` and stops — `draft-to-publication` (claim → note → resolve), `crdm-close` (resolve), `code-change-review` (claim → resolve). Each of them manufactured the condition; none discharged it; **219 beans** accumulated until the owner asked for the sweep by hand.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "owner",
        "2026-09-20"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/todo-manager.md#provenance-27",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Where this sits against `resolve` — two layers, not two spellings",
      "prov:value": "(bean `folio-assistant-m8gz`; owner, 2026-10-20: a step op).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean `folio-assistant-m8gz`",
        "owner",
        "2026-10-20"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/todo-manager.md#provenance-28",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Where the bean ops live — OPEN and CLOSE, called by every process",
      "prov:value": "Owner, 2026-10-24 (option A, bean `m8gz`): *call it, and consolidate.*",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean `m8gz`",
        "Owner",
        "2026-10-24"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-24"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "work-plan/skills/work-plan/todo-manager.md#provenance-29",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Where the bean ops live — OPEN and CLOSE, called by every process",
      "prov:value": "`Process_BeanDrain` (`sdlc/processes/bean-drain.bpmn`, bean `bssi`) is the same over a queue: build the queue grouped by owner, then for each bean OPEN → work → CLOSE, and refill when a drainer's list runs dry.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean `bssi`",
        "owner"
      ]
    },
    {
